{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:48 2026-11-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:48 2026-11-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:48 2026-11-03 HKT</p><img alt=\"美股開市英偉達領漲 蘋果Palantir業績後現跌勢 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/8795f8e0518ead66ed41733d5cd2aee8/2026-11/stock_photo_4_1200x676_0.jpg\"/><p>美股開市，三大指數升跌不一，幅度輕微，道指開盤跌0.5%，納指漲0.6%，標普500漲0.3%。</p><p>科技股之中，以英偉達（NVDA）表現較好，盤中升約3%，之前連跌兩大棍的英特爾（INTC）亦升4%，台積電（TSM）升2%。</p><p>昨天收市後公布業績的蘋果（AAPL）及Palantir（PLTR），跟隨近期「出業績即插」的走勢，開市初段分別跌2.6%及4%。</p><p>今日收市後，輪到美國超微公司（AMD）出業績。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:02:18.902140+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T14:48:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T21:18:51.731171+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:59:31.491880+00:00","content_hash":"6eda7739d76479a1a81e0fcfbcfceabb5a5acd5a62b01279e30e56cd269d1764","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}